{
  "chapter": 7,
  "title": "Huafei Victory",
  "scriptId": "ch0799",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "You escaped RongMoMo and still kept your voice steady. Impressive. Irritating, but impressive.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/deadline/huafei_story.png",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "assets/combat/bgm/huafeiStory.wav",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I'll take that as a compliment.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "You should. I do not distribute them cheaply.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "So what now? Are you going to call me common again?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "Only if you insist on behaving like prey.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "...That was weirdly motivational.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "Success does not belong to the timid. When you step on stage, you cannot beg the audience to love you. You must behave as though their admiration is already yours.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "So... confidence?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "More than confidence. Superiority. Not cruelty. Not arrogance without substance. Presence.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Huh.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "Hold your head higher, speak as though your dream deserves space, and others will begin to believe it too.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "That's... actually useful.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Huafei",
      "text": "Of course it is. Advice from me would naturally be of the highest quality.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    }
  ]
}
